{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>JAIL DICE: Roll to Break</strong></i> is an <strong>Extraction Puzzle Action Game</strong> that blends <strong>Real-Time Combat</strong> and <strong>Turn-Based Progression</strong> coexist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/JD_Capture-01.gif?t=1741501546\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control the dice-shaped fighter, <strong>[ Dice-Mobil ]</strong>, to destroy enemies and collect resources in the underground laboratory's battle zones. As more enemies continuously spawn, you won\u2019t be able to stay in the battle zone for long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/JD_Capture-02.gif?t=1741501546\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To exit the battle zone and move to the maintenance room, you must collect all six <strong>[ Hexagonal Golden Keys ]</strong>. You\u2019ll need to make wise decisions\u2014should you <strong>keep gathering resources</strong> in the battle zone, or focus on <strong>collecting the keys and escape</strong> to the maintenance room?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/JD_Capture-03.gif?t=1741501546\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you successfully return to the maintenance room, use the collected resources to unlock new abilities for the Dice-Mobil. Each new ability drastically changes the course of battle and helps uncover clues about <strong>[ JAIL DICE ]</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/JD_Capture-04.gif?t=1741501546\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Repeat the cycle of battling, retreating to the maintenance room, and upgrading the Dice-Mobil. Once you have strengthened it enough, locate and destroy your <strong>Ultimate Target\u2014[ JAIL DICE ].</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/JD_Capture-05.gif?t=1741501546\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3579010?t=1741501546","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/be485efb5ef8bb8742e9fe7570cc3dab3a188d1a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741501546","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/7a630bbba092f09fd03837a4734b59854acc997e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741501546","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/7a630bbba092f09fd03837a4734b59854acc997e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741501546","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>JAIL DICE: Roll to Break</strong></i> is an <strong>Extraction Puzzle Action Game</strong> that blends <strong>Real-Time Combat</strong> and <strong>Turn-Based Progression</strong> coexist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/JD_Capture-01.gif?t=1741501546\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control the dice-shaped fighter, <strong>[ Dice-Mobil ]</strong>, to destroy enemies and collect resources in the underground laboratory's battle zones. As more enemies continuously spawn, you won\u2019t be able to stay in the battle zone for long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/JD_Capture-02.gif?t=1741501546\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To exit the battle zone and move to the maintenance room, you must collect all six <strong>[ Hexagonal Golden Keys ]</strong>. You\u2019ll need to make wise decisions\u2014should you <strong>keep gathering resources</strong> in the battle zone, or focus on <strong>collecting the keys and escape</strong> to the maintenance room?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/JD_Capture-03.gif?t=1741501546\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you successfully return to the maintenance room, use the collected resources to unlock new abilities for the Dice-Mobil. Each new ability drastically changes the course of battle and helps uncover clues about <strong>[ JAIL DICE ]</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/JD_Capture-04.gif?t=1741501546\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Repeat the cycle of battling, retreating to the maintenance room, and upgrading the Dice-Mobil. Once you have strengthened it enough, locate and destroy your <strong>Ultimate Target\u2014[ JAIL DICE ].</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/extras/JD_Capture-05.gif?t=1741501546\" /></p>","developers":["GyoonyGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579010/5482d7c657384ca9fd0ca51a81527206d4a4f876/header.jpg?t=1741501546","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"JAIL DICE: Roll to Break","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 84